{"id":"09b80989dbe14044","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-theory-system.md","title":"Canonical System Presented by a Theory Set","display":"df-theory-system — Canonical System Presented by a Theory Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-theory-system","aliases":["92-df-theory-system"],"display":"df-theory-system — Canonical System Presented by a Theory Set","depends_on":["[[92-df-formal-system]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","[[92-ax-generalization]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-theory-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-theory-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory-system — Canonical System Presented by a Theory Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence-set presentation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> (arithmetic signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span> (the fixed Hilbert rules)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormalSys}\">\\(\\mathrm{FormalSys}\\)</span> (formal-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G\\)</span> (definition-target presentation constructor)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G:\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\to\n\\{\\mathcal F\\mid\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\coloneqq\n(\\Sigma_G,T,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G:\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\to\n\\{\\mathcal F\\mid\\mathrm{FormalSys}(\\mathcal F)\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\coloneqq\n(\\Sigma_G,T,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\)</span>把句子集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>作为公理集，并配上本书固定的签名与Hilbert规则，因而是可证关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span>的合法左参数</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>是已经闭合的理论集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\)</span>仍是不同类型的对象；应写<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T))\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T))\\)</span>，而不是把集合<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>直接当成形式系统</li>\n<li>断言<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T))=T\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T))=T\\)</span>还需要<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>对所选演绎关系闭合；本定义本身不额外断言该等式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formal-system","status":"resolved","id":"6a1ff87567369c3c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formal-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-modus-ponens","status":"resolved","id":"16613851c4bce386","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-generalization","status":"resolved","id":"906680bfce5f44c0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-generalization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","i